flick-tiler (1.5) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Record every change of tiling on or off, arrangement, main window
    width, gap and the apps that always float in
    ~/.local/state/flickos/history.jsonl, for Settings > History
    (flickos-control), unless history.enabled is off.
  * mode, ratio and gap take default, which removes the user's value;
    ratio is saved while no daemon runs, like mode and gap.

 -- Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 08:22:44 +0800

